B.aS9=new A.bC("warningSigns","1. Signs that a hard moment is starting","Thoughts, feelings or situations that tell me it is coming")
B.aSV=new A.bC("copingSteps","2. Things I can do on my own","Wudu, a walk, a du\u2019a, breathing, a shower")
B.aSO=new A.bC("distractionPeople","3. People and places that help me think of something else","A friend\u2019s house, the masjid, a cafe")
B.aSo=new A.bC("peopleToAsk","4. People I can ask for help","Names and numbers of people I trust")
B.aSL=new A.bC("professionals","5. Professionals and lines I can contact","My doctor, a counsellor, the help line for my country")
B.aSe=new A.bC("safeSpace","6. Making my space safer","Anything I can put out of reach, or ask someone to hold")
B.aSm=new A.bC("reasons","7. What I am living for","People, hopes, things I love")
