B.abl=new A.eE("Quran","Indeed, with hardship comes ease. Indeed, with hardship comes ease.","Quran 94:5\u20136",null,null)
B.abr=new A.eE("Hadith","No fatigue, illness, anxiety, sorrow or grief touches a Muslim \u2014 not even a thorn \u2014 but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.abx=new A.eE("Dua","La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 the dua of Yunus in the three darknesses.","Quran 21:87 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3505","sahih","Darussalam")
