B.abw=new A.eE("Hadith","Allah says: I am as My servant thinks of Me, and I am with him when he remembers Me.",u.M,null,null)
B.abF=new A.eE("Hadith","The Quran will come as an intercessor for its companions on the Day of Resurrection.","Sahih Muslim 804 \u2014 meaning",null,null)
